flowchart LR
  subgraph zg[zvec-grep - where to look]
    files[Workspace files] --> index[On-disk index<br/>BM25 + local vectors]
    index --> zsearch[mcp__zvec_grep__zvec_grep_search]
  end

  subgraph pm[PaperMemory - what can be claimed]
    ingested[Ingested papers] --> chunks[Content-addressed markdown<br/>and byte-slice chunks]
    chunks --> claims[Claims anchored<br/>to exact quote spans]
    claims --> evidence[quote_check · trace · cite]
  end

  zsearch --> agent[Agent]
  evidence --> agent
  agent --> answer[Answer, notebook,<br/>or manuscript]

  note[zvec-grep is fail-soft: no daemon means no search tool.<br/>PaperMemory is fail-loud: a broken store is surfaced,<br/>never read as an empty memory.]
  note -.-> agent

  classDef discovery fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef evidence fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef note fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  class files,index,zsearch discovery
  class ingested,chunks,claims,evidence,agent,answer evidence
  class note note
